#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:74
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "## Threat Sources"
msgid "### Four Rounds"
msgstr "## 威胁源"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:81
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Check | Description |\n"
#| "| ----- | ----------- |\n"
#| "| `l2 < l3` | Otherwise invalid |\n"
#| "| `new l3 ≥ old l3` | Monotonic |\n"
#| "| `new l2 > old l2` | Strict right shift, else abort |\n"
msgid ""
"| Round | Intent                                   |\n"
"| ----- | ---------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 1     | Contradiction detection + expiry marking |\n"
"| 2     | Split multi-fact entries                 |\n"
"| 3     | Dedup merge similar entries              |\n"
"| 4     | Pin maintenance (keep pinned ≤ 20)       |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 检查            | 说明               |\n"
"| --------------- | ------------------ |\n"
"| `l2 < l3`       | 否则无效           |\n"
"| `新 l3 ≥ 旧 l3` | 单调               |\n"
"| `新 l2 > 旧 l2` | 严格右移，否则放弃 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/sleep.md:83
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "**Ordering rationale:** Clean problems first (contradiction+expiry), then refine (split), then merge. Each round sees clean data after prior rounds.\n"
msgid "**Ordering rationale:** Clean problems first, then refine, then merge, then trim resident pins.\n"
msgstr "**顺序理由**：先清理问题（矛盾+过期），再细化（拆分），最后合并。每轮看到的是前序轮处理后的干净数据。\n"

